{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>45歲前港姐亞軍朱慧敏（Queenie）自下嫁心臟科醫生陳良貴後，火速「三年抱兩」湊夠一個好字。將重心轉移家庭的她，不時在社交平台大晒溫馨家庭樂。近日，Queenie就連環發布兩段與一對寶貝仔女的甜蜜互動影片，除了一家四口齊齊落水的歡樂時光，更有被1歲半細仔Aten親自「投餵」的搞笑畫面，幸福滿瀉！</p><figure><img alt=\"朱慧敏2021年覓得好歸宿，嫁給心臟名醫陳良貴（Jason），然後2023年朱慧敏誕下囡囡Shera，2025年4月再誕一子Aten，成功湊成一個「好」字！（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251218/1078377097069596672209376.jpeg/8WIz2C4oE6al5aCme4u6UwMvYiOC51sq6BdeJugXXiY\"/><figcaption>朱慧敏2021年覓得好歸宿，嫁給心臟名醫陳良貴（Jason），然後2023年朱慧敏誕下囡囡Shera，2025年4月再誕一子Aten，成功湊成一個「好」字！（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱慧敏與心臟科醫生陳良貴（Jason）婚後，四年內接連誕下一兒一女。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181260461195137024981367.jpeg/px2fM8oAm4nF1ikL7MtZKZE3GY5jX3ujgIGGU4CBhlM\"/><figcaption>朱慧敏與心臟科醫生陳良貴（Jason）婚後，四年內接連誕下一兒一女。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><p>無懼天寒地凍晒泳衣照？自爆陀B日日游水</p><p>Queenie日前在IG分享了一段一家四口在室內泳池游水的短片。片中見到她穿上墨綠色泳衣，身材Keep得極弗，一臉幸福地抱住3歲大女Shera；而老公陳良貴則負責在旁照顧1歲半細仔Aten，兩父子十足十餅印一樣，畫面甜到漏。</p><p>面對近日天氣轉涼，Queenie在帖文中幽默留言：「天寒地凍，當然是去游泳了！哈哈 🤣 開玩笑的！這段片段其實是八月拍的，一直留著自己重看，現在才公開。」她又透露一對寶貝都極度喜歡游水，更分享了陀B時的零水腫秘訣：「我懷著娃娃時，從懷孕六個月起，差不多每天都去游泳，整個孕期完全沒有腰背痛，也沒有水腫和腳腫。懷著弟弟時，娃娃當時只有八個月大，所以我跟她爬、去playgroup，活動量很多不知道是不是這些原因，兩個小孩都喜歡游泳呢 🥰」</p><figure><img alt=\"一家四口咁凍游水？來係8月時拍攝舊片段。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644666982895616571043.png/Uys3nc_DcvoAnmppX8doPNa9ucUXYBIvit_DYorfw2I\"/><figcaption>一家四口咁凍游水？來係8月時拍攝舊片段。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱慧敏身材好Fit。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644664298409984061845.png/82jfDMWXWb9V_HoA6pWknG5wtZYADZ9C9lo4XfZaOF0\"/><figcaption>朱慧敏身材好Fit。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一對仔女同爸爸餅印一樣。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644844317937664948635.png/lTt2a-_s_8pnd0ILk1ltVkQn6i97_3dNrSv1260r9ds\"/><figcaption>一對仔女同爸爸餅印一樣。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644847275053056512698.png/UXqw7IXKGwCGs0C50M06MQCxdcaLfocs3f1kGt39ZBo\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口互動好溫馨。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644850022453248826510.png/PyZIDM085vmyP9MxJiNAg8pDeR4oGKnmtr2inra9op4\"/><figcaption>一家四口互動好溫馨。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644852790824960573298.png/r8IIK6bqHjLrgJmQVI91--jUWxCK9qrsQSNmkkEjZpI\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644855278178304602819.png/SNWLvxd-dx_umHcxIs1LFB6MHshOoEs3ITLQeCEy0Hg\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644844485709824913085.png/mMkOQ3c-pLHEUteExv0QG1vJTITmQPzy89cBF_PXARc\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644847312801792479065.png/rj4OSipQHNOANHwGBdJW2m_NveIoueHDFIGEZhSBhGY\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644849959538688034129.png/G4HC1fhdcGQvo7INvJVcaUSOaaObO_Rz-DOPlvgzj5Y\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644852623052800102478.png/fBfxlUL-Q8_MWCM2-3BnPbYMhp2A8UQKURcK0FEXCtA\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644855286566912139562.png/X3_QpGLY3j5KiZkjwNvHF7BiiHDEMdJ_RpVdcUaVXXE\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644841570668544426195.png/VVRsLlQh-9Zh1Fuxg4LIsmOvjWON8ifUkCBo5ZAgaOU\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644844376788992432816.png/4b13mTddxyU8wDRuIIRhl-cn_co8-eK7w0uCGMNLghg\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644847115800576260789.png/Y9LAdzud0DMTMmwQ9bjB4my31NmQP0Nz44NH4uODR-I\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644849980641280869051.png/UdMKyg359aWhXAIckyGQyGxHIuruk-sCOQBKqjkASqo\"/><figcaption>一家四口好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><p>獲細仔親自投餵　網民笑指：細佬唔想食</p><p>除了游水片，Queenie昨日（23日）再更新IG，上載與囝囝Aten的搞笑互動。影片中，Aten坐在兒童餐椅上戴著防水圍兜食零食，Queenie則在旁不時張大嘴巴，發出「啊嗚啊嗚」的聲音扮作咬兒子。估不到Aten見狀竟然興奮地哈哈大笑，更主動伸手拎起碗中的食物，親自餵到媽媽口中。</p><p>這段母子溫馨「投餵」片引來不少網民點讚，紛紛留言大讚Aten年紀細細已懂得分享，極度乖巧；不過亦有網民錯重點搞笑發問：「細佬係咪唔想食，全部畀晒媽媽食，好可愛的BB」。</p><figure><img alt=\"細仔不停餵媽咪食嘢。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644954305564672976302.png/4KjvZBkObwq5MpcF87X7lHkRaqKoBp0IPcqYVT3KmFU\"/><figcaption>細仔不停餵媽咪食嘢。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"睇相都好似有聲咁，笑得好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644952002760704540831.png/37htZQNL3qFvy36c4yT01FYTiSh_ZMfVot-Dv6Lfg78\"/><figcaption>睇相都好似有聲咁，笑得好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不停餵。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644949544767488514728.png/lY-CC-77qtc8XjZ4BW0Dj1PJ1v5DmGZaKfpcmin6XJo\"/><figcaption>不停餵。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玩得好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201644947145494528013248.png/t95c-ALxUMgY3bFErOo61LWMMF8rhjEe6BpjcugaY3I\"/><figcaption>玩得好開心。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><p>大女Shera慶祝兩歲生日舊照：</p><figure><img alt=\"朱慧敏日前發布新片，分享喺家中為愛女Shera慶祝兩歲生日。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251218/1078377718443151360578943.jpeg/cD1IoU2mLNXUG00GW_0sYkSTLUdF5wOnbxs7hW8bO4U\"/><figcaption>朱慧敏日前發布新片，分享喺家中為愛女Shera慶祝兩歲生日。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"雖然佈置簡約，但一家人齊齊點蠟燭依然溫馨。壽星女Shera著住粉紅衫襯牛仔褲，頭戴蝴蝶頭箍，不但遺傳了媽咪的一雙長腿，仲用BB話自唱生日歌兼英文數蠟燭，非常精靈。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251218/1078377720674652160492306.jpeg/ip8k6Q8Ws1__MdUK5ua3wU4XFUWzFIwbtMLj-7TC4_s\"/><figcaption>雖然佈置簡約，但一家人齊齊點蠟燭依然溫馨。壽星女Shera著住粉紅衫襯牛仔褲，頭戴蝴蝶頭箍，不但遺傳了媽咪的一雙長腿，仲用BB話自唱生日歌兼英文數蠟燭，非常精靈。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吹一遍蠟燭不夠還要再點多一次。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251218/1078377722889375744763105.jpeg/lD68iNQUSDuxs3wNE0Btdl5iWT0_UDgyFFJx5BRSceQ\"/><figcaption>吹一遍蠟燭不夠還要再點多一次。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"相反細佬Aten就似足米芝蓮，全程表現冷靜，唯獨對個蛋糕虎視眈眈。當媽咪將蛋糕遞畀家姐嗰陣，Aten終於忍唔住伸手想摸，好在朱慧敏眼明手快制止，場面相當惹笑。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251218/1078377724898578432274893.jpeg/M9GwdSB0ZypsHfHPfrM7DEIJJ7v4cafyDr7Fbw6-xW8\"/><figcaption>相反細佬Aten就似足米芝蓮，全程表現冷靜，唯獨對個蛋糕虎視眈眈。當媽咪將蛋糕遞畀家姐嗰陣，Aten終於忍唔住伸手想摸，好在朱慧敏眼明手快制止，場面相當惹笑。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"相反細佬Aten就似足米芝蓮，全程表現冷靜，唯獨對個蛋糕虎視眈眈。當媽咪將蛋糕遞畀家姐嗰陣，Aten終於忍唔住伸手想摸，好在朱慧敏眼明手快制止，場面相當惹笑。（IG@queeniechu422）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251218/1078377726786146304480692.jpeg/rJDLz85IM9aDXdtv7U6vO65Ggf9yioLQwLKCssCygrI\"/><figcaption>相反細佬Aten就似足米芝蓮，全程表現冷靜，唯獨對個蛋糕虎視眈眈。當媽咪將蛋糕遞畀家姐嗰陣，Aten終於忍唔住伸手想摸，好在朱慧敏眼明手快制止，場面相當惹笑。（IG@queeniechu422）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.320040+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1845,"images":27,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:45:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:52:57.194922+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:34.079927+00:00","content_hash":"ef71ceafe54807a6b6f973bda429a8e426757aa60dcf9f669c34901b8f5fbbae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}